{
  "voice": "成人男声｜老师清晰",
  "reference": "/Users/zhaozixu/Documents/Codex/2026-06-04/new-chat/work/full_voice_catalog/12-adult-male-teacher-clear.wav",
  "cfg_value": 1.35,
  "inference_timesteps": 12,
  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Asking for advice is not so easy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In a recent study, 74% of people said they were afraid to ask for advice.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The same also applies to case studies.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "But people who ask for advice are more likely to succeed at a task.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "So how do you ask for advice?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Look for the best person to give you advice.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "It's just like choosing the right belt for an outfit.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "It might be easy to ask all your dear friends on social media for advice at once.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "But will you value all the advice equally?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Probably not.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "It might be better to choose one or two people whose opinions you value most.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Ideally, you can have a dialogue with people who have experience in the topic you're asking about.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "For example, in playing chess, provide enough information clearly.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "For example, imagine you can't decide how to organise a club activity.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "You should provide the topic, the place and the time.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "You should also consider when to ask.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "If your questions require a lot of thought, ask the person when he or she is clear-headed.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Remember to double your efforts in checking the information and not to hurry your decisions.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Be specific when you ask questions.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "Imagine you want to start a business and you find a business owner.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Instead of asking, 'What advice do you have for me?'",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Try asking, 'What college classes did you find helpful for starting a business?'",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "Anyway, don't let the fear of being judged stop you from seeking advice.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-23.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
